## Agent skills

Config for `to-tickets`, `to-spec`, `triage`, `domain-modeling`, `wayfinder`. Shared across working copies; in-flight artifacts are copy-local. Details: `.workspace/agents/README.md`.

### Issue tracker

Local markdown under `<copy-root>/.scratch/<feature>/issues/`. Not the native repos' remotes -- don't write there. When work comes from a ticket, that ticket's `Status:` and acceptance checkboxes are part of the work: tick each criterion as it passes, set `Status: resolved` at the end. See `.workspace/agents/issue-tracker.md`.

### Triage labels

Five canonical roles plus the terminal `resolved`, written as a `Status:` line in the issue file. See `.workspace/agents/triage-labels.md`.

### Domain docs

Single-context, two-tier. Canonical `.workspace/GLOSSARY.md` (read it before domain work or naming domain concepts) + `.workspace/adr/`; write provisional terms and unnumbered draft ADRs to `<copy-root>/.scratch/`, promote on ship. See `.workspace/agents/domain.md`.
